 "hast": "\n<p><strong>GitHub registries now work with private repositories.</strong></p>\n<p>In June, we made it possible to turn any public GitHub repository into a\nregistry. Teams asked for the same thing for their internal code: design\nsystems, feature kits, agent rules and conventions that should not be public.</p>\n<p>You can now install from private repositories. If you can read the repository,\nthe CLI can install from it.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"zero-configuration\">Zero configuration</h2>\n<p>If you are logged in to the GitHub CLI, there is nothing to set up.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"gh auth login\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">gh</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> auth</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> login</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>When a repository is not publicly readable, the CLI reads it through <code>gh</code> using\nyour stored credentials. The token stays inside the GitHub CLI. It never enters\nthe shadcn process.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"✔ Using gh credentials.\n✔ Checking registry.\n✔ Created 1 file:\n  - lib/auth.ts\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>✔ Using gh credentials.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>✔ Checking registry.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>✔ Created 1 file:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  - lib/auth.ts</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ci-support\">CI support</h2>\n<p>Where the GitHub CLI is not installed, set <code>GH_TOKEN</code> or <code>GITHUB_TOKEN</code>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"GH_TOKEN=github_pat_xxx npx shadcn@latest add acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">GH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">github_pat_xxx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\"> npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>We recommend a fine-grained personal access token scoped to the repository with\n<strong>Contents: Read-only</strong> access.</p>\n<h2 id=\"works-with-every-command\">Works with every command</h2>\n<p>Private repositories work with the same commands as public GitHub registries.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest list acme/internal-toolkit\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest list acme/internal-toolkit\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest list acme/internal-toolkit\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest list acme/internal-toolkit\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest list acme/internal-toolkit\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> list</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/internal-toolkit</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest search acme/internal-toolkit --query auth\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest search acme/internal-toolkit --query auth\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest search acme/internal-toolkit --query auth\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest search acme/internal-toolkit --query auth\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest search acme/internal-toolkit --query auth\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> search</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/internal-toolkit</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --query</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> auth</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest view acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest view acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest view acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest view acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest view acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> view</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/internal-toolkit/auth-kit</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest registry validate acme/internal-toolkit\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest registry validate acme/internal-toolkit\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest registry validate acme/internal-toolkit\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest registry validate acme/internal-toolkit\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest registry validate acme/internal-toolkit\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> registry</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> validate</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/internal-toolkit</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Public repositories are read anonymously, exactly as before. No credentials\nare used and the GitHub CLI is never invoked.</li>\n<li>The CLI tries anonymous access first and only uses your credentials when the\nrepository is not publicly readable.</li>\n<li>Private files are read through GitHub's Contents API, pinned to the resolved\ncommit SHA.</li>\n<li>A token from <code>GH_TOKEN</code> is only ever sent to <code>api.github.com</code>. Stored GitHub\nCLI credentials are read by <code>gh</code>, not by the CLI.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See the\n<a href=\"/docs/registry/github#private-repositories\">Private repositories</a> docs for\nthe full guide.</p>"
}
